e monitoring of thyroid function tests advised. Schedule follow-up in 3-6 months. \n\n--- 02/21/2024 Office Visit --- \nS: Frank Frye returns for follow-up on his thyroid He reports feeling a bit more fatigued and has occasional palpitations. He denies any recent weight changes or other significant symptoms. He is compliant with his liothyronine 5 mcg medication. \n\nO: Vitals: \nBP: 141/85 \nWeight: 176 lb \nExam: \n- Cardiovascular: Regular rate and rhythm, no murmurs \n- Thyroid: No palpable nodules, size within normal limits \n- Respiratory: Clear to auscultation bilaterally"
